~ start
Do you want to open the drawer?
- Yes
	do DialogueHandler.open_drawer()
- No
=> END

~ shipping_tag
This is a shipping tag. Do you want to flip it over?
- Yes
	do DialogueHandler.show_tag()
	This is probably not enough evidence alone to incriminate Miller, but it's a good start.
	- Take the evidence
		do DialogueHandler.hide_tag()
		do DialogueHandler.evidence_found += 1
		do DialogueHandler.update_evidence.emit("tag")
	- Just leave it for now
		do DialogueHandler.hide_tag()
- No
=> END

